                                                "sense_id": "198ba014-2961-319b-b702-99a4c861c3e6",
                                                "text": "A great bargain also had been the excellent Axminster carpet which covered the floor; as, again, the arm-chair in which Bunting now sat forward, staring into the dull, small fire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51e9ae84-7373-30bd-b7b3-4d76b0d4c6d0",
                                        "entry_id": "221e6689-b843-33ba-bdec-bbcf0685fcb7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exceptionally good of its kind."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e426532d-3dfb-46d6-895f-7686a1f371f4",
                                                "sense_id": "51e9ae84-7373-30bd-b7b3-4d76b0d4c6d0",
                                                "text": "Bill and Ted had an excellent adventure last week in preparation of their history exam."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b755ff2-22a6-417d-816c-d4f4424fcdbc",
                                                "sense_id": "51e9ae84-7373-30bd-b7b3-4d76b0d4c6d0",
                                                "text": "Not long ago, it was difficult to produce photographs of tiny creatures with every part in focus. That’s because the lenses that are excellent at magnifying tiny subjects produce a narrow depth of field. A photo processing technique called focus stacking has changed that."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72a836e7-94dc-38cf-a096-6c328a7d049e",
                                        "entry_id": "221e6689-b843-33ba-bdec-bbcf0685fcb7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Superior in kind or degree, irrespective of moral quality."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a73e8fb3-52b7-416c-bae7-b19128f8b280",
                                                "sense_id": "72a836e7-94dc-38cf-a096-6c328a7d049e",
                                                "text": "Elizabeth, therefore, who was an excellent hypocrite"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53fda9d5-a44a-4b85-8371-84875132ddd4",
                                                "sense_id": "72a836e7-94dc-38cf-a096-6c328a7d049e",
                                                "text": "Their sorrows are most excellent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
